/E (Greetings from the Department of Management Sciences at IIT Kanpur! Since 1974, we've been a driving force in Data and Analytics, Management Sciences, Operations Research, and more. Our holistic Ph.D., M.Tech, and MBA programs foster complete techno-managers equipped to excel in complex business environments. With a diverse student body, our vibrant learning environment sparks innovative ideas. )
